                    <thead class="table-light">
                        <tr>
                            <th style="width: 20%;">Package</th>
                            <th style="width: 10%;">Version</th>
                            <th style="width: 35%;">What It Does</th>
                            <th style="width: 35%;">Why It Was Chosen (The Rationale)</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-monospace fw-bold text-primary">Hl7.Fhir.R4</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-dark">6.6.0</span></td>
                            <td>Official Firely .NET SDK for FHIR Release 4 models, serializers, and clinical datatypes.</td>
                            <td>Writing custom POCO classes for 145+ resources with polymorphic types (<code>value[x]</code>) is unmaintainable. Firely is HL7-endorsed and battle-tested.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-monospace fw-semibold text-secondary">Hl7.Fhir.Base</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-secondary">6.6.0</span></td>
                            <td>Core serialization engine and base primitive abstractions.</td>
                            <td>Handles low-level streaming JSON/XML writers and reader reflection pipelines.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-monospace fw-semibold text-secondary">Hl7.Fhir.Conformance</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-secondary">6.6.0</span></td>
                            <td>Conformance engine and Profile validator.</td>
                            <td>Validates whether generated JSON complies with hospital rules and StructureDefinitions.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-monospace fw-semibold text-secondary">Fhir.Metrics</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-secondary">1.4.0</span></td>
                            <td>UCUM clinical unit conversion and dimensional calculus engine.</td>
                            <td>Validates clinical units (e.g. <code>mg/dL</code> vs <code>mmol/L</code>) to prevent medication and lab measurement unit errors.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="font-monospace fw-semibold text-success">Markdig</td>
                            <td><span class="badge bg-success">1.4.0</span></td>
                            <td>High-performance, zero-allocation Markdown to HTML pipeline.</td>
                            <td>Renders in-app Living Documentation (Docs-as-Code) directly from version-controlled Markdown files in the project root.</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
